        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · 26 November, 08:33 UTC.&lt;/b&gt; The pull request that added the ScaledObject was merged with three values still SET-ME. The server dry run refused it (spec.maxReplicaCount must be of type integer), so every deploy failed before it changed anything, moks-cms release restarts included. The site kept its 2 pods." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="520" width="920" height="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · After #25 the plan step named each SET-ME and stopped&lt;/b&gt;, so the failure showed on the pull request itself. Since #26 it leaves a ScaledObject with any SET-ME out, with one warning per value, and deploys the rest; a SET-ME in any other kind still stops the run." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0f172a;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
